# Baked into every production build (craco build / yarn build:blog).
# Without it CRA compiles the lead-form endpoint as "undefined/api" and the
# home page + /ads forms silently 404 (happened 2026-10-29 -> 2026-11-09).
# Not a secret: it is the public API address. An explicit env var still wins.
REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=https://mukbuddy-api.tal.one
